<h1>Legend</h1>
<p>Symbol taxonomy based on my writing on
    <a href="https://brennan.day/blogging-with-magic-unicode-simple-doesnt-have-to-mean-boring/">ASCII characters</a>.</p>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Symbol</th>
            <th>Type</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--quote">&gt;</span>
            </td>
            <td>Quote</td>
            <td>Passages worth remembering</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--bookmark">⚹</span>
            </td>
            <td>Bookmark</td>
            <td>Links to external resources</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--note">●</span>
            </td>
            <td>Note</td>
            <td>Longer-form ideas and concepts</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--diary">🜁</span>
            </td>
            <td>Diary</td>
            <td>Personal logs and reflections</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--snippet">🜃</span>
            </td>
            <td>Snippet</td>
            <td>Code and technical notes</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <span class="sym sym--stub">☉</span>
            </td>
            <td>Stub</td>
            <td>Placeholder pages for future development</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<h2>Categories &amp; Themes</h2>
<p>A second, orthogonal taxonomy: what a note is
    <em>about</em>, not what it
    <em>is</em>. Optional, click a symbol to see every note tagged with it.</p>
<h3>Thematic Categories</h3>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Symbol</th>
            <th>Theme</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for category in categoryList %}
            {% if category.group == "zodiac" %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <a class="theme-symbol {{ category.color }}" href="/category/{{ category.slug }}/">{{ category.symbol }}</a>
                    </td>
                    <td>{{ category.label }}</td>
                    <td>{{ category.description }}</td>
                </tr>
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>
<h3>Technology Subcategories</h3>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Symbol</th>
            <th>Theme</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for category in categoryList %}
            {% if category.group == "planet" %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <a class="theme-symbol {{ category.color }}" href="/category/{{ category.slug }}/">{{ category.symbol }}</a>
                    </td>
                    <td>{{ category.label }}</td>
                    <td>{{ category.description }}</td>
                </tr>
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>